WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:01.960
The cost of doing business,

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.294
is compromise:

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:06.131
Big or agile,

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.800
ambitious or stable…

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:13.138
At IBM, we don't let these contradictions hinder us.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:16.766
Instead, we combined hardened, open source software,

00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:18.643
with industry-leading security,

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:21.980
to reimagine our enterprise grade public cloud.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:25.692
It connects you with the world’s most innovative technologies.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:30.280
But you encrypt your data at the highest level so no-one else can access it.

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:34.117
It lets you build portable applications with speed and confidence, 

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.580
while providing visibility across all your clouds from a single dashboard.

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:40.707
It’s already running our business,

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.917
and primed to run yours.

